Package: asciicam
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-numpy, python3-picamera2
Maintainer: ErnestG4 <ErnestG4@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Live camera to ASCII art in the terminal
 Renders the camera feed as ASCII art in any terminal, on the device
 LCD console or over SSH; the grid follows the terminal size. Multiple
 character ramps, truecolour mode, edge detection, flipping, gamma
 control and frame export to text. Works with the built-in CSI camera
 (picamera2), any V4L2 webcam (OpenCV), or a synthetic test pattern.
